"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons/issues/new?body=module:%20crm_lost_reason_transition%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
